    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Fox</strong> is a 2D action-exploration metroidvania where you play as a small fox on an adventure full of challenges, secrets, and abilities to uncover. Explore ancient ruins, face unique enemies, and unlock new ways to move as you traverse a charmingly hand-crafted pixel art world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by genre classics, <strong>Rising Fox</strong> combines tight platforming, agile combat, and skill-based progression. As you advance, new tools will let you access hidden areas, solve environmental challenges, and face increasingly dangerous bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/3d7852b3ed72ba8b8106a7fffe0fa11a.avif?t=1753717146\" width=480 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interconnected world in true metroidvania style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a nimble and expressive fox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/c58261906e31799d5e17a545a3e0e679.poster.avif?t=1753717146\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/c58261906e31799d5e17a545a3e0e679.webm?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/c58261906e31799d5e17a545a3e0e679.mp4?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging combat inspired by classics of the genre</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities that change how you explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/5a873117ed9b823def3208bc46e917ce.poster.avif?t=1753717146\" width=800 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/5a873117ed9b823def3208bc46e917ce.webm?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/5a873117ed9b823def3208bc46e917ce.mp4?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and gamepad support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed pixel art and smooth animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/628790bc1b2fbcfd09a16b2078c54b32.poster.avif?t=1753717146\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/628790bc1b2fbcfd09a16b2078c54b32.webm?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/628790bc1b2fbcfd09a16b2078c54b32.mp4?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Fox</strong> is a 2D action-exploration metroidvania where you play as a small fox on an adventure full of challenges, secrets, and abilities to uncover. Explore ancient ruins, face unique enemies, and unlock new ways to move as you traverse a charmingly hand-crafted pixel art world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by genre classics, <strong>Rising Fox</strong> combines tight platforming, agile combat, and skill-based progression. As you advance, new tools will let you access hidden areas, solve environmental challenges, and face increasingly dangerous bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/3d7852b3ed72ba8b8106a7fffe0fa11a.avif?t=1753717146\" width=480 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interconnected world in true metroidvania style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a nimble and expressive fox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/c58261906e31799d5e17a545a3e0e679.poster.avif?t=1753717146\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/c58261906e31799d5e17a545a3e0e679.webm?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/c58261906e31799d5e17a545a3e0e679.mp4?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging combat inspired by classics of the genre</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities that change how you explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/5a873117ed9b823def3208bc46e917ce.poster.avif?t=1753717146\" width=800 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/5a873117ed9b823def3208bc46e917ce.webm?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/5a873117ed9b823def3208bc46e917ce.mp4?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and gamepad support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed pixel art and smooth animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/628790bc1b2fbcfd09a16b2078c54b32.poster.avif?t=1753717146\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/628790bc1b2fbcfd09a16b2078c54b32.webm?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/628790bc1b2fbcfd09a16b2078c54b32.mp4?t=1753717146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
